{
  "worlds": [
    {
      "id": "quarry",
      "order": 2,
      "name": "The Quarry",
      "stages": [
        "quarry-road",
        "cut",
        "shaft",
        "ledger"
      ],
      "castle": "shaft",
      "statue": "E"
    }
  ],
  "quests": [
    {
      "id": "quarry.road",
      "world": "quarry",
      "title": "Clear the road south",
      "kind": "main",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "cut",
          "objective": "Clear the wall of rubble. Stand in front of it, press 4x.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "trigger",
            "trigger": "quarry.through"
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "river",
          "objective": "Cross the river. Stand on the bank, press 5r= to lay planks.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "trigger",
            "trigger": "quarry.far"
          },
          "then": []
        },
        {
          "id": "south",
          "objective": "Follow the road to the gate on the far bank.",
          "completeWhen": {
            "type": "stage-cleared",
            "stage": "quarry-road"
          },
          "then": []
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "openingStage": "quarry-road",
  "openingQuests": [],
  "dialogues": [
    {
      "id": "quarry-road.intro",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The Quarry. The Unwriter walked through and the\nroad is buried. Clear it, then cross the river."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.ash",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Road's buried, child. Half the cut came down.\nThat pile of rubble is three stones. Three.",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "We don't dig here. We delete. x deletes one\ncharacter: the stone you stand on.",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "When stone goes, the row slides shut. So count\nthe rubble (3), then your own stone (1).",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Stand in front of it and press 4x.\nOne move, and the road's open.",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        },
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "name": "Foreman Ash",
          "text": "Cut too much? :e! puts the whole quarry back.\nNo shame in it. I've done it twice. Today."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "quarry.knows-x",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.ash-again",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Stone doesn't argue, child. Stand in front\nof the rubble and say 4x. Three plus you.",
          "name": "Foreman Ash"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.kit",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "Ash says the Unwriter walked right through\nthe cut. Didn't even stop. Rude, I'd say.",
          "name": "Kit"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.kit-later",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "npc",
          "text": "I heard the wall whisper once. What if we're\nalready gone? ...Sorry. Long shift.",
          "name": "Kit"
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.note",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "scribe",
          "text": "Note: water won't hold you, planks will.\nr= puts a plank where you stand."
        },
        {
          "speaker": "scribe",
          "text": "The river is 4 tiles, plus your own: 5r= lays\nfive planks in one move."
        }
      ],
      "then": [
        {
          "type": "set-flag",
          "flag": "quarry.knows-r",
          "value": true
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.through",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "A river, and Blots on the far bank. Read the\nnote pinned by the water to cross."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry.crack",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Through a crack in the rock: this same quarry,\nbut emptier. No road. No one."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry-road.death-hint",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "Rubble: stand in front, press 4x. River: stand\non the bank, press 5r= for planks."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    },
    {
      "id": "quarry-road.end",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "system",
          "text": "The road south is open. Below, someone is\nbuilding, row on row. Follow the sound."
        }
      ],
      "then": []
    }
  ],
